1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,530
Developer ne poocha: website chahiye, app, ya software?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,750
Aur aap? Bilkul confuse.

3
00:00:07,086 --> 00:00:09,256
Teeno ka kaam bilkul alag hai.

4
00:00:09,226 --> 00:00:12,916
Aur ghalat cheez pe paisa lagana, sab se mehenga sauda hai.

5
00:00:12,984 --> 00:00:15,314
Chalo, mithai ki dukaan se samajhte hain.

6
00:00:15,678 --> 00:00:21,928
Pehla: website, yaani dukaan. Log aate hain, mithai dekhte hain, rate dekhte hain.

7
00:00:22,087 --> 00:00:28,177
Doosra: app, yaani delivery bike. Seedha customer ki jeb mein, baar baar order.

8
00:00:28,519 --> 00:00:35,649
Teesra: software, yaani godown ka munshi. Andar ka saara hisaab: stock, staff, aur bill.

9
00:00:36,019 --> 00:00:40,269
Yaad rakho: pehle dukaan, phir bike, phir munshi.

10
00:00:40,314 --> 00:00:45,204
Aap ke paas kya hai? Comment karo: dukaan, bike, ya munshi.

11
00:00:45,655 --> 00:00:49,105
Confuse ho? DM karo, free call pe samjhayenge.

12
00:00:49,075 --> 00:00:53,885
Save karo, follow karo. Seedhi baat, no bakwaas. Localhost Labs.
